NAME
       whoami - print effective user name

SYNOPSIS
       whoami [OPTION]...

DESCRIPTION
       Print the user name associated with the current effective user ID.
       Same as id -un.

       --help display this help and exit

       --version
              output version information and exit

FILES
       /etc/passwd   user account database

SEE ALSO
       id(1), groups(1)

